Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不会停留原地\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.51,0:07:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,警员们 请答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Units, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到报告 发现了一具被肢解的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting reports of a body found dismembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 你是说"被肢解"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back. Was that "dismembered"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,案发现场在狂欢节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scene is near the south entrance...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,南部的入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the festival grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,收到 警车已出动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. En route.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:07:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要封锁交通吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any directive for TC?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,警长说封锁德利镇街道大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief said to tape off the Derry Street Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候 它会回来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, it comes back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:51.53,Note,,0,0,0,,(回家吧 回家吧 回家吧)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:09:05.42,Title,,0,0,0,,《小丑回魂2》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:17.64,Note,,0,0,0,,(阁楼)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,丹柏先生 他们需要您去一下拍摄现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Denbrough? They need you on set.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.10,0:09:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,走这条路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just going to go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要钻过去 我要钻过去 - 别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm doing it. I'm doing it. - No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 离门远点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Clear the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你没看过《夺宝奇兵》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on. You've never seen Indiana Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看路啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你是剧组成员吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. You a crewmember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是作者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你老公来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你写好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Do you have the pages?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人 远离起重机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, keep clear of the crane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友 电影需要一个结尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, a film needs an ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道这一点 对吧 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do know that, right? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.69,0:10:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你说再给你一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that you needed another day...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你就能写好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to finish the pages,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们今晚就该拍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're shooting this thing. It's tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那只有17小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, like, 17 hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都冷静一下 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, calm down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.31,0:10:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望这个电影能拍的让你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to be happy with the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂不懂我是站在你这边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand? I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是太好了 因为在我书里的结局…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. 'Cause in my book, the ending...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,非常糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 人们爱过你的书 爱过\N{\fnArial\fs30}All due respect, people loved your book. Loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们都讨厌结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hated the ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过你喜欢我的结局来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you liked the ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.97,0:10:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,骗你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要做得更好 好吗 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta do better, okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.87,0:10:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,奥德拉 你懂我意思 能不能和他说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Audra, you have my notes. Would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 十分感谢 请送我回一号位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, thank you very much. Take me back to one, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂他意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have his notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hate my endings, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是所有结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all your endings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行吧 - 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 你难道想让我一直骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Do you want me to keep lying to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就因为我是你的老婆 - 你是我老婆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- just because I'm your wife? - You're my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 不过你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你过去八年来一直在激怒我的边缘试探\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been blowing smoke up my ass for eight years?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你有时候不是你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I thought you were someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:10:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有激怒你过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not been blowing smoke up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都喜欢幸福结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody wants a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都想要个大团圆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody wants closure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但是生活往往不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not the way life works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,想想彼得想要什么 电影公司想要什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what Peter wants and what the studio wants...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,电影公司 你什么时候成个商人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The studio? When'd you become a company man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 你是个艺术家啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, you're an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 以我写的方式去演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. What's wrong with just doing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么了 以我想要的方式去演\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way it's written? The way I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,当那个我想让你当的女人到底有什么错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with being the woman I want you to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说剧本里的那个角色 不是说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the page. The part, I mean. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔·丹柏吗 我是迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill Denbrough? It's Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克·韩洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike Hanlon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.37,0:11:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,德利镇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Derry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要回家一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪 我一直在和你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I keep telling you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.82,0:11:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样吓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to scare me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,可你从来不听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you never listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,玛拉 拜托 现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Myra, please. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在不该出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪 你现在开车不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, it's not safe to drive...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,路面还很湿滑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the roads are slick like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,甜心 三小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, it stopped raining, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,雨就停了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}three hours ago. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不会出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的 傻逼 懂不懂交规啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dickhead! Flow of traffic mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你打滑失控了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you hydroplane?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会打滑失控的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hydroplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,评估风险是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my job to assess risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我说你就信\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, please trust me when I tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,从统计学上来讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}that, statistically speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在出交通事故的风险要高得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am much more likely to get into an accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我正在边开车边和你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I am talking to you on the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,行吗 我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,回头再说 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will talk to you soon. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.19,0:12:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是艾德华·卡斯布拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edward Kaspbrak speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有像平时一样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't say, "Okay, bye, I love you,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"好的再见 我爱你"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you usually do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 没法聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我开会要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be late to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:35.21,Note,,0,0,0,,(来电等待 缅因州 德利镇)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.21,0:12:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,说"我爱你" 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "I love you," Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我爱你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I love you, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,玛拉 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myra. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.11,0:12:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.69,0:12:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude! Dude, what the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你五秒钟前还好好的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were fine, like, five seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁啊 谁打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it? Who called? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇 说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich? Rich? Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还有两分钟你就该上台了 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on in two minutes. You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你看上去可不咋好\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you look not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 你没事 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fine. - You're fine? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.09,0:13:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来了 我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're walking. We're walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还有60秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.87,0:13:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,走快点 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even faster. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.22,0:13:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,给他拿瓶水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get him a bottle of water, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 波旁威士忌 - 波旁威士忌 行 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bourbon. - Bourbon. Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,再来个薄荷糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得我不行 - 你要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think I can do this. - It's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真快啊 - 你行的 你牛逼得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was fast. - You kill. You're a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们可以上台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We are good to go, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们往哪走 往哪走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Where we going? Where we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这边走 乖孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This way. Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.49,0:13:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我看上去怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的手在抖 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hands are shaking, Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有请瑞奇·托兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}please welcome Richie Tozier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 大家今晚怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. How are we doing tonight?
