Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴臭…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trashmouth. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.73,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我把笑话忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgot the joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你真垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们今天这次展示的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}for letting us present to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.49,0:14:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这栋建筑包含上百万平方米的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this will include over a million square feet...
