Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.24,0:14:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,最先进的办公大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}State-of-the-art office towers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.82,0:14:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我想要搞明白的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm really looking for is to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.35,0:14:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们如何去创造更多的零售商机\N{\fnArial\fs30}how we create even more retail opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.50,0:14:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们在这里 这里都建墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we put in walls here and all along here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不要墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 汉斯康先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, Mr. Hanscom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,请叫我本 我也无意冒犯你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, please. And with all due respect to you,
