Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我都要犯幽闭恐惧症了 你们不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just looking at this model. Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 建更多的墙 只会让这个地方更像一座监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Throw up more walls, it's gonna feel like a prison.
