Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪一小会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我是德利镇的迈克·韩洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Mike Hanlon. From Derry.
