Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你工作能请下来假吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure you can get away from work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是夏天 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's summer, why not?
