Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?
