Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,德利镇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Derry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 对不起 你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, sorry. Yes, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有 我不知道为什么我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,过去多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long's it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,27年\N{\fnArial\fs30}27 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:16:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,它回来了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's come back, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你给我打电话的原因吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're calling me?
