Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.33,0:19:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都必须回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all do.
