Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这周你已经很累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this week's been really exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是接到了德利镇一个老朋友的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a phone call from an old friend from Derry.
