Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.52,0:31:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,回来和你们坐在一起我觉得轻松多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel very relieved to be here with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.97,0:31:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么这么看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is everybody looking at me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.68,0:31:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克打给我的时候 我撞车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Mike called me, I crashed my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.65,0:31:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的假的 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.71,0:31:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到迈克声音时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, man, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.02,0:31:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心脏就像真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, my heart was literally...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.27,0:31:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要跳出胸腔一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}pounding right out of my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.68,0:31:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还以为只有我这样 - 就好像是纯粹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought it was only me. - It was like pure...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.61,0:31:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.41,0:31:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们感受到的 就是恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fear. What you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.49,0:31:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么会有这种感觉 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did we all feel like that, Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.53,0:32:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是记得一些我们忘记的事情 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember something we don't, don't you, Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.16,0:32:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们离开镇子时 童年记忆开始模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happens to you when you leave this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.18,0:32:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,离得越远 越记不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}The farther away, the hazier it all gets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.52,0:32:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我没离开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me, I never left.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.39,0:32:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.60,0:32:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.11,0:32:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,所有事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.58,0:32:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,潘尼怀斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pennywise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.85,0:32:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那个该死的小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the fucking clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.75,0:32:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我靠 - 潘尼怀斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - Pennywise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.10,0:32:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 你说想要我们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, you said you wanted our help with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.02,0:32:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.70,0:32:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,在德利镇 每27年\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an echo here in Derry...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.33,0:32:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,历史就会重演一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}that bounces back every 27 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.06,0:32:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.08,0:32:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你先听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Listen, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.65,0:32:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我们以为杀死了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we stopped It back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.52,0:32:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,以为一切结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought It was done, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.96,0:32:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.24,0:32:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一周前 有个叫艾德里安的男人被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week ago, a man, adrian Mellon, slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.35,0:32:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,前阵子晚上 有个叫丽萨·奥布里齐的女孩失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A girl, Lisa Albrecht, the other night, went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.09,0:32:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.70,0:32:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的案例 之后还有会有更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There've already been others, and there will be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.94,0:32:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想听这些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear about this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.84,0:32:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 更多的死亡 更多的痛苦 - 冷静点 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More death. More pain. - Calm down. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.92,0:32:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再干一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get another drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.00,0:33:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,让他解释 让他解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him explain. Let him explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.84,0:33:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你解释啊 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explain it to us, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.33,0:33:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那个轮回\N{\fnArial\fs30}That echo,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.00,0:33:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可能改变了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might have changed It,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.85,0:33:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就像它改变了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like It changed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们没能阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we didn't stop It.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.13,0:33:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,因为它又重演了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because It just bounced back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.30,0:33:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们发过誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.08,0:33:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才召集你们回来 所以你们才坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I brought you back. That's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.12,0:33:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,将它斩草\N{\fnArial\fs30}To finish It.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.89,0:33:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,除根\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.57,0:33:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的有点暗黑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that shit got dark fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.74,0:33:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢了 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.27,0:33:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的幸运饼干是"会"\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fortune cookie just says "Could. "
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.57,0:33:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他们这里的幸运饼干不正宗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know how to do fortune cookies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.91,0:33:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我的是"猜"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine just says "Guess. "
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.97,0:33:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把纸条放我这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna throw that over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.74,0:33:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你的是什么 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got, Mikey?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.74,0:33:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.46,0:33:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我说的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.84,0:33:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"猜-割-不-会-它"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Guess. Cut. Not. Could. It. "
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.13,0:33:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是一条信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.65,0:34:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 "猜它会不会割"\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, "Guess it could not cut. "
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.58,0:34:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是"猜它会不会割"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would it guess it could not cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.85,0:34:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 割什么 - "猜它会不会割"\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cut what? - "Guess it could not cut. "
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.94,0:34:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.81,0:34:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- "它"在前 在这里 - "它不可能猜到"\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "It" goes in front. There. - "It could not guess. "
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.52,0:34:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它不可能猜到 - "可能它"\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It couldn't guess. - "Could it..."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.00,0:34:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 "它可能不会割吗"\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. "Could it not cut. "
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.21,0:34:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这个"它"说的是不是小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it says "It," Is it talking about It?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.94,0:34:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 是那个意思吗 "它"是小丑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. All right. - Is that what it means? Is "It" It?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.54,0:34:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思 迈克 这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it? Mike. Where does this go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.25,0:34:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我说的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.09,0:34:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它…可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It... It could...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.68,0:34:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道这他妈什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what it fucking means!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.41,0:34:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是你动了幸运饼干吗 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuck with the fortune cookies, Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.65,0:34:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 让他说 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Whoa. Let him speak, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.72,0:34:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我做的 是它做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not me. This is what It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我的吸入器去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my fucking inhaler!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.38,0:34:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要搞我们 你为什么要给我们打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you, man? Why'd you call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.29,0:34:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这不好笑 - 这不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is not fucking funny! - This is so not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.76,0:34:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 贝弗莉 - 这不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beverly? - This is so not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.41,0:34:45.95,Note,,0,0,0,,(史丹利)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.05,0:35:00.30,Note,,0,0,0,,(猜猜史丹利会不会割腕)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.37,0:35:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会说史丹利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it say Stanley?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.12,0:35:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁他妈的能回答我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else fucking answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.26,0:35:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.96,0:35:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.47,0:35:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那他妈是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is that, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.62,0:35:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.29,0:35:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.84,0:35:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.16,0:35:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.44,0:35:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.43,0:35:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.37,0:35:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运饼干在瞪着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That fortune cookie's looking at me! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.40,0:35:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我要离开这 我呆不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be here. I can't fucking do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.75,0:35:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回家 我不想呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna go home! I don't wanna be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.51,0:35:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.34,0:35:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回家 我不想呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna go home! I don't wanna be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.77,0:35:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.16,0:36:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.25,0:36:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.92,0:36:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.99,0:36:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是真的 不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real! It's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.17,0:36:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不是真的 不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real! It's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.02,0:36:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是真的 不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real! It's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.73,0:36:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不是真的 不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real! It's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.99,0:36:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是真的 不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real! It's not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.12,0:36:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.91,0:36:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我们结下帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Could we get the check?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.76,0:36:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是潘尼怀斯搞的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Pennywise does, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.21,0:36:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他在整我们 史丹利应该没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fucks with us. So, Stanley's probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.13,0:36:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 你有他电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike. Do you have Stan's number?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.51,0:36:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.05,0:37:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.53,0:37:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.05,0:37:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.81,0:37:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏刚刚上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fun's just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.64,0:37:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.30,0:37:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he said, is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.28,0:37:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得有趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.18,0:37:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.13,0:37:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这是游戏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think this is some sort of game, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.73,0:37:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,操你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, fuck you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.17,0:37:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇 注意轻重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich, be careful, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.87,0:37:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,操你妈 我不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you! I'm not afraid of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.56,0:37:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"好戏刚刚上演"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The fun's just beginning. "
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.14,0:37:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你脱口秀的台词啊 我是你粉丝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The line from your act, dude. I'm a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.33,0:37:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是你家长吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are those your parents? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.39,0:37:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要合照吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.76,0:37:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 迪恩 - 我不要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay, Dean? Come on. - I think I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.12,0:37:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 很可爱的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, cool. He's a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.02,0:37:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 瑞奇 你不记得你自己节目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Richie. You don't remember a line...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.88,0:37:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,台词吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your own show?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.24,0:37:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是我自己写的台本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't write my own material.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.43,0:37:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈就知道 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucking knew it! I fucking knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.14,0:37:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 尤瑞斯太太 我是贝弗莉·马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mrs. Uris. My name's Beverly Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.39,0:37:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.53,0:37:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你丈夫的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm an old friend of your husband's.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.59,0:37:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗了我们 那可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to us. That's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.26,0:38:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该一开始就坦诚告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, first words out of your mouth should have been like,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.66,0:38:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"喂 兄弟 你想回德利镇送死吗"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, man. You want to come to Derry and get murdered?"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.16,0:38:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这样我就会拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause then I would have said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.77,0:38:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.52,0:38:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking entrapment, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.11,0:38:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.02,0:38:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.81,0:38:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.37,0:38:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.70,0:38:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他走的方式 太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was horrible, the way he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.80,0:38:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他的手腕\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在浴缸 - 在浴缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the bathtub. - In the bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.68,0:38:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.04,0:38:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很遗憾 帕蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all very sorry, Patty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.57,0:38:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.36,0:38:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,史丹利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.90,0:38:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,潘尼怀斯算到了 在我们之前算到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pennywise knew. He knew before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.42,0:38:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要阻止它 我有个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to stop him. I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.09,0:38:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个赶紧逃走的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a plan. Getting the fuck out of Dodge...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.96,0:38:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,趁着还没到比尔书里的结局那么惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}before this ends worse than one of Bill's books.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.04,0:38:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谁加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.67,0:38:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们彼此发过誓的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a promise to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.06,0:38:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们一起背弃誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's un-make the promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.61,0:38:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇 无辜的人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, other people are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.01,0:38:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都有人死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other people die every day, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.26,0:38:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又不欠这镇子什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't owe this town shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.04,0:39:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我大概两小时前才记起我在这里长大这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, I just remembered I grew up here, like, two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.99,0:39:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我他妈走了 去他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'm fucking leaving. Fuck this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.78,0:39:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我同意瑞奇的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man, I'm with Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.33,0:39:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小艾 别这样 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eds, please. - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.74,0:39:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们呆在这会死的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? We stay, we die, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.73,0:39:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回旅馆 收拾行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go back to the inn, I'm gonna pack up my shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.95,0:39:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,然后开车回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm gonna drive to my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.69,0:39:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉兄弟 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.96,0:39:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别走 艾迪 拜托了 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Eddie. Please. Please, Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.94,0:39:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.07,0:39:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.72,0:39:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna head back to the Town House, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.07,0:39:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一起吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you coming? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.44,0:39:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该坦诚的 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have told us, Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.72,0:39:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill. Please, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.99,0:39:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我求你了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.90,0:39:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,请你听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen to me, man. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.61,0:39:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.10,0:39:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you possibly say...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.11,0:39:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,能改变现状吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would make any kind of a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.58,0:39:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.83,0:39:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你看样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就一样 你想走的话 随时可以走\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing. And if you want to leave, you can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.77,0:39:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你先看看 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me show you this first. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.57,0:40:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"一圈歪" 什么破名字啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lapskew! What kind of name is that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.62,0:40:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈都打得比你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom swings better than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.87,0:40:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我说多少遍啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.25,0:40:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,她不会打棒球都比你们强 垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't even play baseball! You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.87,0:40:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 还要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, how much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.42,0:40:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,维多利亚 我们来看比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victoria, we came to watch the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.94,0:40:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就好好看比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna watch the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.73,0:41:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你好小维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Vicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.54,0:41:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你朋友也这样叫你吧 小维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that what your friends call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.07,0:41:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小维\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicky?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.07,0:41:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.86,0:41:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,说明我也是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I must be your friend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.62,0:41:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是我的朋友 为什么躲在黑暗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're my friend, why are you hiding in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.08,0:41:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是我的朋友 你很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not my friend. You're scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.66,0:41:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你哭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.64,0:41:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,人们总是因为我的外貌取笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}People always make fun 'cause of the way I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.77,0:42:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你要是看不见我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought if you couldn't see my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.13,0:42:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许愿意跟我做朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}then maybe you'd want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.74,0:42:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.62,0:42:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,又老又蠢的潘尼怀斯 你永远都不会有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, silly old Pennywise, you'll never have no friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.19,0:42:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,人们也取笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}People make fun of me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.46,0:42:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.42,0:42:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.76,0:42:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那也太愚蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, isn't that silly?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.04,0:42:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那个小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That little thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.66,0:42:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就能把它吹走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, I can blow that thing right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.70,0:42:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.64,0:42:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.10,0:42:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,轻轻一吹就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One poof and it'd be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.21,0:42:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你得离我很近 近到能看见我的脸才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have to get close enough to see my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.29,0:42:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定了 小维\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Vicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.81,0:42:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没关系 我不会笑你的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's okay. I won't make fun. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.21,0:42:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你保证吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.39,0:42:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, okie-dokie!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.94,0:42:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来靠近一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come on in a little closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.74,0:42:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,然后数到三我就把它吹走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll blow it away on the count of three!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.06,0:43:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.81,0:43:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}two...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.18,0:43:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该要数三了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to say three.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.91,0:43:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,卧槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.55,0:43:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.67,0:44:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.77,0:44:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 霍克斯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Hockstetter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.60,0:44:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.32,0:44:24.28,Note,,0,0,0,,(德利旅馆 无空房)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.29,0:44:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上行李然后我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get our shit and get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.34,0:44:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你把你的行李放这里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you leave your stuff here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.85,0:44:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 还在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my stuff's still in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.74,0:44:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 告诉我 - 告诉你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me. - Tell you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.87,0:45:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你此刻在害怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is you're afraid to tell me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.84,0:45:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev. Bev.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.89,0:45:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才在酒店 你在和史丹利的妻子打电话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the Jade when you were on the phone with Stanley's...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.76,0:45:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.57,0:45:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她告诉你她在浴缸里发现他\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told you that she found him in the bathtub,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.73,0:45:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 小贝 我看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, Bev, I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.49,0:45:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了 是你先说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard it. You said it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.79,0:45:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you guys are talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.16,0:45:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快点说完 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's make it happen faster, all right? We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.45,0:45:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华多 安德雷 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eduardo, andale! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.74,0:45:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你有事没告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something you're not telling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.26,0:45:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你早就知道史丹利是怎么死的 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew how Stanley died. You knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.84,0:45:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.85,0:45:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.26,0:45:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,她早就知道史丹利会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}She knew how Stanley was going to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.89,0:45:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她是这么跟你说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that what she just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.25,0:45:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能就这么避而不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just walk away from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.37,0:45:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道他是在哪里自杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know where he killed himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.26,0:45:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.98,0:45:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.28,0:45:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我聊聊 像从前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talk to me. Like we used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.02,0:45:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, how did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.90,0:45:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.04,0:45:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见我们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen all of us die.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.49,0:46:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚拿了我的盥洗用品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I just got to grab my toiletry bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.27,0:46:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.78,0:46:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我错过了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.55,0:46:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The library?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.69,0:46:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方以前是不是更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't this place used to be bigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.45,0:46:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo! Mike, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.84,0:47:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 你住在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, you live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.38,0:47:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.22,0:47:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要水吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want some water? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.24,0:47:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,记忆就是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, memory's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.59,0:47:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.96,0:47:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是一切的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the key to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.56,0:47:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果它真的想要我们回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If It really does want us back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.76,0:47:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得最好的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you think the smartest thing we can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.98,0:47:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就是离开德利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is just get the hell out of Derry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.13,0:47:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 它确实想要我们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It does want us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.66,0:47:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它当然想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course It does!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.85,0:47:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它不知道我知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But It doesn't know I know what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.60,0:47:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.63,0:47:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么杀死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to kill the shit out of It!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.28,0:47:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,每本书我都读了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've read every book.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.34,0:47:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也和这个堕落之镇的所有人都交谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've talked to every person in this godforsaken town,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.58,0:47:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所有愿意和我谈的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody that would talk to me, anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.82,0:47:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然人数不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's not a long list.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.60,0:48:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.18,0:48:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道这一切是如何开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to know how this all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.92,0:48:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,它是如何开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How It started.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.14,0:48:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,它开始于\N{\fnArial\fs30}And It started...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.22,0:48:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里 - 喔噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- here. - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.53,0:48:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 迈克 - 这是个手工艺品\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What am I looking at, Mike? - It's an artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.34,0:48:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来自十八世纪早期的沙科皮族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early 18th century Shokopiwah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.56,0:48:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,沙科…你从哪弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoko... How'd you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.25,0:48:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到的 在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it, in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.89,0:48:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 他们给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, they gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.64,0:48:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.72,0:48:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.42,0:48:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,从印第安人那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Native Americans?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.81,0:48:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这很复杂 - 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's complicated. - Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.01,0:48:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在我旅行的时候帮助了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They helped me on my journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.47,0:48:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.09,0:48:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给我看了一些东西 一幅景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}They showed me things. A vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.24,0:48:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,卧槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.74,0:48:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel kind of funky.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.96,0:48:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,很热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我出汗了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I sweating?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.23,0:48:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你看他们让我看到的景象 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to see what they showed me, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.20,0:48:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.11,0:49:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们生活在德利镇之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}They live outside of Derry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.38,0:49:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,它的势力范围之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond It's reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.83,0:49:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是很多年前搬走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They moved there many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.73,0:49:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是圣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their holy man,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.69,0:49:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,最虔诚的圣人\N{\fnArial\fs30}their holy of holies,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.67,0:49:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们接纳了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he took me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.65,0:49:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,给我喝他们神圣的马图林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fed me their sacred Maturin.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.34,0:49:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始 有了反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started to... to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.10,0:49:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所有生物必须遵循\N{\fnArial\fs30}All living things must abide by the laws...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.08,0:49:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,自身肉体外形的法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the shape they inhabit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.56,0:49:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,当我坐在那里朝山谷外看的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I sat there, looking out over the valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.91,0:49:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw It arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.29,0:49:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道有一天 我会让你们所有人都看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that one day, I would have to make you all see.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.07,0:49:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.30,0:49:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你在我的水里下药了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you put something in my drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.43,0:49:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.26,0:49:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,植物根茎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a root.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.26,0:49:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你给我下药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... You drugged me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.59,0:49:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你给我下药 - 不 那是具有效力的植物根茎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You drugged me? - No, it's a root with properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.63,0:49:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是沙科皮人给我的一小剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a micro-dose of what the Shokopiwah gave me...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.85,0:50:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.98,0:50:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,为了张开你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}To open my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.90,0:50:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.66,0:50:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to look,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.41,0:50:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就会看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.22,0:50:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.82,0:50:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,睁开眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.37,0:50:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,睁开眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.27,0:50:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他们让我看见了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They showed me the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.98,0:50:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看见它是如何显现在他们面前的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showed me the way It appeared to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.31,0:50:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看见了他们的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They showed me their pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.73,0:50:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看见了如何阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}They showed me how to stop It!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.78,0:50:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.41,0:50:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.26,0:51:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧 你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. Did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.56,0:51:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那个仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.57,0:51:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个丘德仪式 - 我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Ritual of Chud? - Yeah, I knew you...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.65,0:51:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你会看见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you would see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.40,0:51:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 一切我都看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the whole fucking thing, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.35,0:51:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我们杀死它的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we kill It.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.85,0:51:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we going to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.05,0:51:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人都拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody already said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.52,0:51:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.41,0:51:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就会听\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.71,0:51:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起 就会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't work without all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.79,0:51:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你说看见我们都死了是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, what do you mean that you've seen us all die?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.77,0:51:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我必须说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause I gotta be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.74,0:51:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是偶然发生的糟心事罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a fucked-up thing to just drop on somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.44,0:51:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,自从我离开了德利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every night since Derry,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.68,0:51:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我都在做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been having these nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.23,0:51:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦的人们 渐渐死去的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}People in pain. People dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.91,0:51:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}People...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.92,0:51:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you have nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.96,0:51:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我做噩梦 所有人都会做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nightmares. People, they have nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.88,0:52:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这不意味着你看见的都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean that your visions are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.37,0:52:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这周我看见了我们每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've watched every single one of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.57,0:52:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见我们每个人 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen every single one of us what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.00,0:52:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,去到了史丹利死的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the place that Stanley wound up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.08,0:52:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我们的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we end.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.71,0:52:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们其他人怎么没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, how come the rest of us aren't seeing that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.42,0:52:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,凭什么她看到的就是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what makes her so different?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.07,0:52:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡之光\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Deadlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.08,0:52:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡之光\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Deadlights.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.76,0:52:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我们中唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the only one of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.03,0:52:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在那天被死亡之光照射到的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that got caught in the Deadlights that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.71,0:52:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都被它触碰到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all touched by It.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.43,0:52:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,被改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.61,0:52:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们内心深处 就像被病毒感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down. Like an infection. Or a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.74,0:52:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,病毒 你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A virus. You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.50,0:53:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slowly growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.90,0:53:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,生长了27年的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That virus, it's been growing for 27 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一直以来 都在生长着\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole time, metastasizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.12,0:53:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只是它先打倒了史丹 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just got to Stan first, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.60,0:53:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他是最弱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the weakest.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.47,0:53:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,老天啊 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.09,0:53:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是把每个人心里的想法说出来而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saying what everyone else is thinking, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.05,0:53:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Rich, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.61,0:53:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗莉所看见的事 都会实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Beverly sees, it will come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.58,0:53:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我们阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what'll happen to all of us, eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.39,0:53:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,否则它就会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless we stop It.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.39,0:53:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.31,0:53:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,丘德仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ritual of Chud.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.23,0:53:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,沙科皮族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Shokopiwah.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.89,0:53:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,第一批对抗它的人 他们有一句谚语\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first ones who fought It, they have a saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.26,0:53:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"所有生物都必须遵循\N{\fnArial\fs30}"All living things must abide by...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.14,0:53:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,自身肉体外形的法则"\N{\fnArial\fs30}The laws of the shape they inhabit. "
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.26,0:53:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,部落仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tribal ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.33,0:53:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈在逗我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you fucking kidding me, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.22,0:53:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一定还有其他的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, there's gotta be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.44,0:53:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这个东西每隔27年就会回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? This thing comes back, what, every 27 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.08,0:53:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不如使用缓兵之计 以后再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just kick the can down the road and do it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.12,0:53:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时候我们就70岁了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, we'll be 70 years old, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.75,0:53:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那样行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't work that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.93,0:53:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们活不到下一个20年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us make it another 20 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.50,0:53:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都逃不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the way it happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.63,0:53:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 如果我们这次不打败它\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if we don't beat It this cycle, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.58,0:53:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We die.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.84,0:54:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖地死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.12,0:54:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想要恐怖的死法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't need the "Horribly" Part.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.96,0:54:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没说 是她说的 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say it. She said it. Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.64,0:54:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.79,0:54:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见了他所说的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen what he's talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.95,0:54:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.95,0:54:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.21,0:54:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们想要这个仪式成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we want this ritual to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.22,0:54:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就要找回记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.56,0:54:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.59,0:54:23.76,Note,,0,0,0,,(寻人启事)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.92,0:54:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果让你们都看过的话会更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better if I show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.95,0:54:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们没有时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.04,0:54:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这次循环马上就要结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cycle will end soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.33,0:54:38.13,Note,,0,0,0,,(德利日报 荒地惊现人体残肢)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.13,0:54:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once it does...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.67,0:54:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.94,0:55:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Barrens.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.78,0:55:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是那次石头大战后\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.28,0:55:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the rock fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.49,0:55:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,俱乐部之屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clubhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.39,0:55:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你给我们造的 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You built that for us. - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.22,0:55:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那个门板一定就在这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hatch has got to be around here someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.97,0:55:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你做的 我还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did. I do remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.61,0:55:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 喔噢 喔噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.53,0:55:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.70,0:55:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 没什么 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Nothing, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.05,0:55:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你一点都没变呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.15,0:55:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.14,0:55:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得那个门好像就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I actually think the door was more like...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.22,0:55:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}around...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.59,0:55:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.29,0:55:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.03,0:55:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.24,0:56:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the dick is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.79,0:56:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.13,0:56:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.34,0:56:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔有空的时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here and there, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.50,0:56:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前就挖好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was already dug out from something,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.61,0:56:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩下墙壁还需要加固一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I just had to reinforce the walls and...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.28,0:56:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,然后再搞一点木头来做门\N{\fnArial\fs30}get some wood for the roof door and...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.37,0:56:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's pretty much it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.69,0:56:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就我的第一次来说 还不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good for my first time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.26,0:56:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那个特点太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's a cool feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.92,0:56:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你把手放到另一根柱子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when you put your hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.90,0:56:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,会发生什么 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the other pillar, professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.21,0:56:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你们知道 为什么这里会有安全规范\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you see, this is exactly why there are safety codes,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.04,0:56:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要准许了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}why we have permits.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.23,0:56:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方太危险了 你明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a death trap. You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.00,0:56:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个还未完工的项目 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a work in progress. Okay, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.96,0:56:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,话说在前头 如果我受伤了 你要负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, I get hurt, you are liable.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.29,0:56:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么 这个铁娘子里的开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, also, what is this? The switch of an iron maiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.47,0:56:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个手电筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.82,0:56:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那又是啥 马栓吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, a horse hitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.59,0:56:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候把马带下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do you have horses down...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.46,0:56:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.74,0:56:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那个东西三美元呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was like, three dollars,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.67,0:56:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}so be careful with that, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.02,0:56:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我有一个这个 嘿 史丹 你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one of these. Hey, Stan, you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.96,0:56:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看见了 你能不要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay, can you maybe not?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.51,0:56:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不要哪样 是哦是哦 等等 不要哪样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not what? Yeah, yeah, hold on. Maybe not what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.45,0:56:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,耍帅 找乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be awesome and have fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.81,0:57:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,享受波板球的魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and celebrate the magic of the paddle-ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.14,0:57:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 蠢蛋 你把它弄坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good going, fucknut. You broke his thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.14,0:57:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我弄坏了 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I broke it? - Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.23,0:57:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你把它弄坏了 用你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}you broke it with your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.87,0:57:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.45,0:57:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会把手伸进那种地方呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not putting my fucking hand down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.05,0:57:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man. That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.38,0:57:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.64,0:57:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么都不记得来过这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we all not remember that this was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.12,0:57:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 废柴们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.32,0:57:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,漂浮吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to float.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.08,0:57:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈 - 你大爷的 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ahh! - Fuck, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.15,0:57:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老兄 - 还记得它以前挂在嘴边的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude! - Remember when he used to say that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.58,0:57:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他还会跳着小舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'd do that little dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.97,0:57:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我一个人记得这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I the only one who remembers this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.48,0:57:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在老家期间你要一直表现得这么怪异吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna be like this the entire time we're home?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.65,0:57:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 我只是想调节一下气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Just trying to add some levity to this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.68,0:57:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪凉快哪呆着去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go fuck myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.70,0:57:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这里味道太臭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells so fucking terrible in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.85,0:58:02.75,Note,,0,0,0,,(废柴专用 史丹)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.76,0:58:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.26,0:58:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这个写着"史丹"\N{\fnArial\fs30}This says "Stan. "
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.52,0:58:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"废柴专用"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For the use of Losers only. "
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.11,0:58:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.78,0:58:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.05,0:58:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让我们在这里的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't get spiders stuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.21,0:58:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不让蜘蛛爬到头发里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your hair when you're down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.49,0:58:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,史丹利 我们才不怕蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stanley, we're not afraid of fucking spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.46,0:58:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我坚守立场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand corrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.14,0:58:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是头一回\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.70,0:58:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touche.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.22,0:58:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 瑞奇 你的十分钟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rich, your ten minutes are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.90,0:58:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.19,0:58:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,说好了每人只能用吊床十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hammock. Ten minutes each was the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.04,0:58:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没看见任何告示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see any sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.34,0:58:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你又开始这样了是吗 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you being this way right now? Really? No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.24,0:58:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果大家都同意了 为什么会没有告示呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would there be a sign if it was a verbal agreement?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.95,0:58:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不记得你们都同意了那个规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember you agreeing on the fucking rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.47,0:58:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你小妹妹露出来了 - 每个人十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can see your vagina! - Ten minutes each.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.71,0:58:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,滚回你的小角落去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back in your dumb little corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.16,0:59:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我操了你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucked your mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.00,0:59:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放屁 你给我把那句话收回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you didn't. Take that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.58,0:59:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,新来的 你还真擅长这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're awfully good at this, new kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.52,0:59:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你真这么觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.33,0:59:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,港口那里有个暑期课程\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's actually a summer program in Bar Harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.63,0:59:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,教你一些建筑学的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teaches you, like, everything about architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.83,0:59:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想申请来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking about applying.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.81,0:59:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我会报名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.26,0:59:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想方设法离开德利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do anything to get the hell out of Derry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.04,0:59:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,等我毕业了 我要去佛罗里达州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, when I graduate, I'm going to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.44,0:59:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,去佛罗里达干嘛 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in Florida, Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.00,0:59:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.45,0:59:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是一直想去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I guess it's just a place I always wanted to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.90,0:59:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,史丹 你应该和迈克一起去佛罗里达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan, you should go with Mike to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.47,0:59:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经像个80岁的老头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already act 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.94,0:59:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你会很受老奶奶喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd clean up with all the grandmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.48,0:59:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们觉得我们还会是朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys think we'll still be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.70,0:59:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们长大之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we're older?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.30,0:59:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.48,0:59:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't we be?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.89,0:59:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的父母现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do any of your parents still hang out...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.25,0:59:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还和他们中学时期的朋友玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with their friends from middle school?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.05,0:59:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 事情是会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, things might be different then.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.18,0:59:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all might be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.52,1:00:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永远都会是朋友的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll always still be friends. I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.65,1:00:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that just...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.08,1:00:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那会因为我们长大而改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}goes away because we get older.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.15,1:00:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 史丹 别这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Stan. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.96,1:00:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用表现得这么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be so...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.27,1:00:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.12,1:00:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直都很早熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was old before his time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.48,1:00:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.70,1:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真好奇他长大了是什么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder what he was like all grown up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.29,1:00:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,也许和他小时候一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably what he was like as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.69,1:00:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,最好的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.44,1:00:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.01,1:00:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 迈克 我们在这里干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Mike. What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.23,1:00:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那个仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.92,1:00:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要进行仪式 需要献祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}To perform it requires a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.30,1:00:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我建议献祭艾迪 - 等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sacrifice? I nominate Eddie. - Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.80,1:00:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你身材最小 放得上烤架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're little. You'll fit on a barbeque.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.98,1:00:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我身高1米79 这可是世界平均水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 5'9". It's, like, average height in most of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.90,1:00:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那种献祭 大伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that kind of a sacrifice, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.45,1:00:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.36,1:00:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,过去被埋葬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The past is buried.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.61,1:01:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你们要去把过去挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna have to dig it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.67,1:01:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一点一点地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piece by piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.77,1:01:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,而那些片段\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these pieces,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.20,1:01:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那些信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}these artifacts,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.77,1:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我们回来的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.28,1:01:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你们的献祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are what you'll sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.43,1:01:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,而既然史丹不在这里 无法挖掘过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since Stan isn't here to find his...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.21,1:01:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们要一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured we should all be here together...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.57,1:01:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,找他的信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find his artifact.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.73,1:01:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得比尔已经找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Bill just did that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.47,1:01:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 迈克 所以我们要去哪里找我们的信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mike, so where do we find our tokens?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.75,1:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须说实话 恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I gotta be honest, man. All due respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.55,1:01:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这太蠢了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is fucking stupid, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.83,1:01:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么需要信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we need tokens? All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.31,1:01:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经记起来所有事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.00,1:01:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们救了小贝 打败了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving Bev, defeating It...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.41,1:01:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're caught up!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.28,1:01:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这还不是全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.11,1:01:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们打了一架 那之后发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought. But what happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.57,1:01:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在内尔波特的房子前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the house on Neibolt.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.42,1:01:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,想一想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.03,1:01:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们记不起来了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't remember, can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.90,1:02:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的故事还有遗漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, there's more to our story.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.77,1:02:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那个夏天发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened that summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.05,1:02:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那些记忆的空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those blank spaces,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.82,1:02:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,像从书上撕掉的书页\N{\fnArial\fs30}like pages torn out of a book.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.14,1:02:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是你们要寻找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you need to find.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.55,1:02:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要分开行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to split up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.44,1:02:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你们每个人都要找到你们的信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You each need to find your artifact.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.66,1:02:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,单独去 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone. That's important.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.02,1:02:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,当你们找到之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you do,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.02,1:02:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚来图书馆找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}meet me at the library tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.80,1:02:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I gotta say,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.19,1:02:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,从数据上来看 如果是求生场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}statistically speaking, you look at survival scenarios,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.49,1:02:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起行动的存活率更高\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna do much better as a group.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.96,1:02:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 分头行动太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, splitting up would be dumb, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.05,1:02:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要一起去 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we gotta go together. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.93,1:02:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们那个夏天就是一起的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were together that summer, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.74,1:02:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.33,1:02:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不是一直都在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that whole summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.09,1:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,收回你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.20,1:02:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.79,1:02:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就是一群懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a bunch of losers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.91,1:02:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.10,1:02:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 操 - 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fucking... - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.48,1:02:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一起弄伤它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all together when we hurt It.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.30,1:02:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们都还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.48,1:02:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 好吧 那我还想多活几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, I plan to keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.50,1:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet by tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.34,1:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们又会团结在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll all be back together.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.30,1:03:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.20,1:03:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们要打败它 就必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we're gonna stop It, we better be.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.62,1:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也许瑞奇是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Richie was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.95,1:03:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们什么都不用做 也许我们什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we shouldn't do anything about It, or maybe we can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.65,1:03:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他们改变你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, don't let them get to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.06,1:03:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这么说有点迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a little late for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.71,1:03:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.72,1:03:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,免得你爸爸看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before your dad sees.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.50,1:04:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.77,1:04:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.10,1:04:15.57,Note,,0,0,0,,(克什)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.57,1:04:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.70,1:04:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这里住的是马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I rang Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.12,1:04:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marsh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.72,1:04:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,艾文·马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alvin Marsh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.81,1:04:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.06,1:04:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在这里长大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I grew up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.16,1:04:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.80,1:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,本不应该由我来告诉你这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not for me to tell you this,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.03,1:04:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 你的父亲去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your father passed away.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.93,1:04:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 你不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.98,1:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很久没有联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hadn't spoken in a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.07,1:04:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不进来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, won't you come in?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.36,1:04:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,让我给你倒点水喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me offer you something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.70,1:04:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's fine. I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.44,1:05:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我唯一能做的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.41,1:05:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.20,1:05:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里和你记忆中的一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it like you remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.96,1:05:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,更干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.80,1:05:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你先四处看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you feel free to look around...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.95,1:05:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我去烧水\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I get the water boiling.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.84,1:05:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 不用了 你不用麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really, it's fine. You don't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.45,1:05:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so polite.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.60,1:06:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是她的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.92,1:06:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能闻到她的香水味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still smell her perfume.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.67,1:06:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是因为你 她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she'd still be alive if it wasn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.95,1:06:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama was sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.72,1:06:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道她那么做是因为她病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's why she did what she did.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.34,1:06:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did what she did...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.74,1:06:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为她为做你的母亲感到羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}because she was embarrassed to be your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.40,1:06:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你长得跟她很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.46,1:06:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你和她完全没得比\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are nothing like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.54,1:06:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.70,1:06:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我说给我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.65,1:06:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.65,1:07:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我永远不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that I would never hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.59,1:07:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.49,1:07:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.36,1:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远都是我的乖女儿 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll always be my little girl, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.16,1:07:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.80,1:08:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"卿之秀发如冬焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your hair is winter fire,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.94,1:08:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,初月余烬未绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}January embers...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.84,1:08:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,引吾心燃烧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart burns there, too. "
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.01,1:09:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,给你 实在抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. I do apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.05,1:09:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,每年这个时候都特别热\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets so very hot here this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.49,1:09:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.98,1:09:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉自己时日无多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you feel like you could just about die.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.93,1:09:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你知道人们怎么说德利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what they say about Derry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.10,1:09:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"这里的人从来都没有真正死去过"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No one who dies here ever really dies. "
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.82,1:09:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 你回到德利有何感想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tell me, how is it being back in Derry?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.58,1:09:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有点怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good. Strange.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.45,1:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.30,1:09:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.80,1:09:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange, how?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.04,1:09:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你来之前我烤了一些饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had some cookies in the oven before you came.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.99,1:09:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,坐在那别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.61,1:09:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不想再给你添麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really... I shouldn't impose... I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.82,1:10:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你一定要尝尝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I insist.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.92,1:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,克什夫人 这是你的家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Kersh, are these your family?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.98,1:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.22,1:10:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲来到这个国家时口袋里只有14美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father came to this country with $14 in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.72,1:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他并没有接受施舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he didn't ask for a handout...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.89,1:10:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不像现在的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way that people come in here these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.87,1:10:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what he did?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.48,1:10:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他做了什么 克什夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he do, Mrs. Kersh?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.59,1:10:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他加入了马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father joined the circus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.60,1:10:37.35,Note,,0,0,0,,(跳舞小丑潘尼怀斯)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.16,1:10:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都是父亲的乖女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was always Daddy's little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.13,1:10:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.23,1:10:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是爸爸的乖女儿吗 贝弗莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still his little girl, Beverly?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.99,1:11:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.72,1:11:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,别对爸爸撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mustn't lie to our father!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.87,1:11:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.87,1:11:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,逃避 你就只会逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, run, run, run.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.90,1:11:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一点都没变啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.78,1:11:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有改变他们的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed their futures.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.31,1:11:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你更没能拯救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... You haven't saved any of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.60,1:11:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖闭上眼 贝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes, Bev.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.13,1:11:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.37,1:12:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不相信我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't believe,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.29,1:12:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就闭上眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}close them...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.09,1:12:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.92,1:12:29.80,Note,,0,0,0,,(感谢那些回忆 德利镇)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.67,1:12:33.55,Note,,0,0,0,,(出租)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.57,1:12:52.24,Note,,0,0,0,,(街头霸王)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.37,1:12:56.91,Note,,0,0,0,,(游戏代币)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.03,1:13:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.65,1:13:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,肯 你这个小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ken, you little bitch...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.34,1:13:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.54,1:13:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真厉害 - 游戏结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're fucking good. - Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.97,1:13:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.40,1:13:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要不再来一局\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we go again?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.42,1:13:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,再玩一会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play some more, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.99,1:13:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.32,1:13:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想的话就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.83,1:13:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 你突然这么肉麻干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, why are you being weird?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.45,1:13:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是你男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your fucking boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.15,1:13:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.66,1:13:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你们他妈在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.84,1:13:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们之前可没跟我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You assholes didn't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.11,1:13:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这里到处是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}your town is full of little fairies.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.88,1:13:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,李察·妈的·托兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie fucking Tozier?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.85,1:13:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 你不会是想干我的小表弟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're trying to bone my little cousin?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.46,1:13:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚出去 死基佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck out of here, faggot!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.21,1:14:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快滚啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking move!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.70,1:14:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,想要亲亲吗 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want a kiss, Richie?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.54,1:14:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是幻觉 幻觉 幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real. It's not real. It's not real. It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.77,1:15:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是幻觉 幻觉 幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real. It's not real. It's not real. It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.01,1:15:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是幻觉 幻觉 幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real. It's not real. It's not real. It's not real.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.84,1:15:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像吓尿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just shit my pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.11,1:15:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 航海节闭幕式今晚举行 - 什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Canal Days Festival. Closing performance is tonight. . - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.48,1:15:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,到时见哦 小帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope to see you there, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.99,1:15:40.36,Note,,0,0,0,,(沉痛悼念 李察·托兹)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.28,1:15:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,想我了吗 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me, Richie?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.37,1:15:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.78,1:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是对你日思夜想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I've missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.95,1:15:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,再也没有人想陪小丑玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one wants to play with the clown anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.88,1:15:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,来和我玩个游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play a game with me, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.52,1:16:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,玩街霸怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Street Fighter?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.90,1:16:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 你超喜欢玩 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. You like that one, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.71,1:16:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不然真心话大冒险也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe Truth or Dare?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.02,1:16:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.12,1:16:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you wouldn't want...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.37,1:16:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,让人听到你的真心话吗 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}anyone to pick "truth," though, would ya, Richie?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.00,1:16:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕别人发现你的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't want anyone to know what you're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.42,1:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,*可我知道你的小秘密*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*I know your secret*
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.45,1:16:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,*你那难以启齿的小秘密*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Your dirty, little secret*
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.01,1:16:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,*你的秘密*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Oh, I know your secret*
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.07,1:16:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,*难以启齿的小秘密*\N{\fnArial\fs30}*Your dirty, little secret*
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.67,1:16:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要我和你朋友们说说吗 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I tell them, Richie?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.75,1:16:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都是幻觉 都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't happening. This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.53,1:16:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,都是假的 都是幻觉 不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't real. It isn't happening. It isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.29,1:16:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,回来玩啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back and play!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.29,1:16:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快回来陪小丑玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back and play with the clown!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.16,1:17:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉 抱歉 - 看着点路 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry. Sorry. - Watch it, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.36,1:17:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.18,1:17:30.22,Note,,0,0,0,,(玫瑰二手专卖店)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.87,1:17:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.12,1:17:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有什么需要的吗 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I help you? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.59,1:17:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看看这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I want to see about the...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.56,1:17:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,棒球卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baseball card?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.99,1:17:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还是保龄球\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bowling ball?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.83,1:17:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.60,1:17:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,班卓琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Banjo?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.78,1:17:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,海狸标本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beaver?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.67,1:17:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking bike.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.55,1:17:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你要用这种方式说话的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna use that kind of language,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.88,1:18:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那就出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}take it out in the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.31,1:18:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.60,1:18:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就当什么都没发生过好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just start over and pretend that I just walked in?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.97,1:18:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么需要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.46,1:18:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我想买那辆自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Yes. I want to buy the bike.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.14,1:18:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是威廉·丹柏吗 那个作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you William Denbrough, the writer?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.40,1:18:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.05,1:18:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.52,1:18:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那辆自行车本来是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bike used to be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.17,1:18:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但是它现在归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's mine now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.67,1:18:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你可是大作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're the big author.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.86,1:18:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你想买它不是轻而易举\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it, you can afford it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.75,1:18:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,行 开个价吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. How much?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.12,1:18:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,三百\N{\fnArial\fs30}$300.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.33,1:18:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can afford it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.77,1:18:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我给您拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.96,1:18:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这算是谈妥了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's kind of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.00,1:18:48.20,Note,,0,0,0,,(威廉·丹柏 《黑流》)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.17,1:18:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你 想要个签名吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... You want me to sign it for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.11,1:18:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,免了 结局不咋地\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't like the ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.16,1:19:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,三百美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three big ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.90,1:19:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,车是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.79,1:19:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道还能跑多快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how fast she'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.63,1:19:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,放那好多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been there a lot of years.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.94,1:19:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,老人家 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, mister?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.85,1:19:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她曾经可是我的驱魔座驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was fast enough to beat the devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.55,1:19:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,加把劲 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.30,1:19:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I missed you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.80,1:19:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.67,1:19:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,银翼号 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi-ho, Silver!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.41,1:19:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.38,1:20:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.00,1:20:33.80,Note,,0,0,0,,(杰克逊街)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.10,1:20:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你就在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.60,1:20:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你能听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.03,1:21:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I have to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.14,1:21:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,镇上明明有这么多孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of the kids in this town you could have taken,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.75,1:21:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么偏偏挑中了小乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}why Georgie?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.36,1:21:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.67,1:21:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么偏偏是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why him?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.78,1:21:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why him? Why him? Why him?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.09,1:21:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.93,1:21:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不在啊 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you weren't there, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.85,1:22:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,比利 别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.43,1:22:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.17,1:22:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.71,1:22:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我还被困在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.99,1:22:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.13,1:22:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,小乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.76,1:22:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,小乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.09,1:22:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.54,1:22:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.56,1:22:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.07,1:22:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快要够到你了 加把劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you, buddy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.08,1:22:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.70,1:22:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.50,1:22:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我在这 快把手给我 - 比利 求求你 他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got you. Come on. - Billy, please. He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.59,1:22:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓住我的手 - 比利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take my hand. - Billy!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.09,1:22:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,快 抓住我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.99,1:23:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.51,1:23:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.13,1:23:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你在和谁说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.13,1:23:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,躲开 躲开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.57,1:23:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,躲开 躲开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.75,1:23:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,听到下水道的声音了吗 离它远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear voices from that sewer, you stay away from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.50,1:23:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,下水道有声音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear voices from the sewer?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.28,1:23:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.39,1:23:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 离下水道远点就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Just stay away from that sewer.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.24,1:23:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我只在浴缸里听到过怪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only hear voices in the tub.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.83,1:23:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,从下水道传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know. From the drain.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.77,1:23:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of voices?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.31,1:23:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.69,1:23:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,有时又像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And other times, like a...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.05,1:23:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a clown?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.06,1:24:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 认真听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me. You listen good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.58,1:24:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out of this town.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.12,1:24:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你父母说 随便找个理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Tell your parents. Make up a reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.73,1:24:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,编个谎 我不管你用什么方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make up a fucking lie. I don't care what you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.48,1:24:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能离开这里就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get out of this town.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.48,1:24:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,永远别再回来了 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make them never bring you back. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.91,1:24:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,离开德利镇 别再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave Derry and you stay out of Derry!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.80,1:24:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.19,1:24:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去狂欢节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be at the festival.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.65,1:24:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,说你听懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.14,1:24:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去狂欢节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to be at the festival.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.35,1:24:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.73,1:24:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be careful!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.98,1:24:42.86,Note,,0,0,0,,(欢迎德利镇暑期班学生)
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.70,1:25:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 赶紧他妈离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's get the fuck outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.46,1:25:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒 肥猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, fat-ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.34,1:25:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,死废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.54,1:25:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别怕 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.63,1:25:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的朋友要去哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you and your little buddies up to in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.30,1:25:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那些可不是我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys are definitely not my buddies.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.80,1:26:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说你真正的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I meant your real friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.40,1:26:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊 乔纳森 唐尼 丹尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey. Jonathan. Donnie. Danny.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.38,1:26:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然在学校抽烟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you smoking in school?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.37,1:26:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是我的秘密基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret hideout.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.27,1:26:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.45,1:26:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧 新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, new kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.11,1:26:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.11,1:26:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm just worried...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.53,1:26:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那次争论过后我们没办法和好如初\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're not all gonna be the same after the fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.78,1:26:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只要还能一起玩 谁在乎这些呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we can still hang out, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.00,1:26:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你说真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.97,1:26:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了 小傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah, of course, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.13,1:26:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.19,1:27:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.38,1:27:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说朋友那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.68,1:27:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你真以为我会喜欢像你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually thought I could like someone...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.47,1:27:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,又肥又恶心的家伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}as fat and gross and disgusting like you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.92,1:27:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,写多少肉麻情诗也无济于事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how many stupid poems you write.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.50,1:27:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"卿之秀发如冬焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your hair is winter fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.16,1:27:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,初月余烬未绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}January embers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.28,1:27:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,引吾心燃烧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart burns there, too. "
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.51,1:27:47.09,Note,,0,0,0,,(肥猪)
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.06,1:27:59.24,Note,,0,0,0,,(贝弗莉·马什)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.13,1:28:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是贝弗莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the real Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.11,1:28:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗莉不会说那样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly would never say anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.77,1:28:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她绝不会说那样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd never say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.06,1:28:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,给我你的吻 小胖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss me, fat boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.79,1:28:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没人想吻死胖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nobody wants to kiss the fat boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.10,1:28:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.63,1:28:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.66,1:28:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直都是一个人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you've always been alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.58,1:28:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说 我有朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true. I have real friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.89,1:28:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 艾迪 迈克 史丹利 瑞奇和贝弗莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill. Eddie. Mike. Stanley. Richie. Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.08,1:28:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是我的好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're my real friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.93,1:29:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,像上次那样亲吻我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kiss me as if it were the last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.93,1:29:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么 小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing, kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.17,1:29:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.61,1:29:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.43,1:29:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.38,1:29:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did you see out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.54,1:29:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想见到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something I wish I hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.23,1:29:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所以怎么办 我们就\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, we just...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.59,1:29:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干掉它 然后又忘记一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill It, and then we just forget everything again?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.77,1:29:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,希望如此 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.21,1:29:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.39,1:29:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望我能留存那些美好的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I want to hold on to the good stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.67,1:30:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 对于过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. There must be something from...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.05,1:30:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定也有不想忘记的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the past that you don't want to forget again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.36,1:30:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得我被吓得屁滚尿流\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember being scared shitless.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.33,1:30:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷的笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.96,1:30:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得你们穿着三角短裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you guys in your tighty-whities.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.59,1:30:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 这个就忘了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Please forget that moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.94,1:30:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.68,1:30:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,有个男孩给我写了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the boy who wrote it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.66,1:30:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太记得他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not him, so much,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.71,1:30:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,而是他给我的那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}but how he made me feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.85,1:30:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,和他的吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.83,1:30:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,太模糊了 不过我觉得我们在这待得越久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still blurry, but I think the longer we're here,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.49,1:30:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,记忆就能越清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.58,1:30:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,多看看那个场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more I can see that moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.85,1:30:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就能想起更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more I can see...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.61,1:30:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.34,1:30:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.83,1:31:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 你还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Do you remember...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.18,1:31:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.93,1:31:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让开 让开 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move. Move. - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.44,1:31:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要离开这鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.23,1:31:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You can't leave, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.61,1:31:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,分开了 大家都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We split, we all die.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.93,1:31:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要试试 反正早晚都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll take my chances. We're gonna die, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.22,1:31:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.32,1:31:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.47,1:31:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,海狸宝宝祝你早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kids! It's Burrow the Beaver!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.47,1:31:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快来哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on down.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.52,1:31:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是航海节的最后一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the last day of the festival here at Canal Days.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.11,1:31:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.30,1:31:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.76,1:32:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,您需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.14,1:32:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I called in...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.05,1:32:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个给卡斯布拉克的处方药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had prescription called in for Kaspbrak.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.64,1:32:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯布拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaspbrak?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.23,1:32:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,吸入器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an inhaler.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.71,1:32:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是艾德华·卡斯布拉克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Kaspbrak?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.58,1:32:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.82,1:32:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.57,1:32:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.05,1:32:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈妈近来还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.04,1:32:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,她几年前就去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she died a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.13,1:32:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,很不幸 是死于肝癌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very sad. It was from liver cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.53,1:32:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.82,1:32:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's what? - That.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.55,1:32:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.25,1:32:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别挤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.36,1:32:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,挤不出来 这是个痣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not gonna pop. It's a mole.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.42,1:32:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是肿瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not be cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.04,1:32:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,肿瘤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cancer?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.19,1:32:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it might be.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.10,1:32:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在这等我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.13,1:32:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我去给你拿点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.55,1:32:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.50,1:33:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,又来拿治口臭的药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came here for your stinky breath pills?
