Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.48,1:46:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,去他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck them.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.78,1:46:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要去里诺约会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got dates in fucking Reno, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.69,1:46:53.70,Note,,0,0,0,,(史丹利·尤瑞斯)
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.73,1:46:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在我刚刚读到的句子中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reflecting on the meaning of what I just read,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.92,1:46:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,多次提到"升华"二字\N{\fnArial\fs30}the word "Leshanot" comes up a lot,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.61,1:47:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是"改变和转变"\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means "To change, to transform. "
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.21,1:47:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很符合今天的主题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes sense, I guess,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.58,1:47:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,因为即日起我就要真正成人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because today I'm supposed to become a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.10,1:47:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,其实挺有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.77,1:47:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得每个人都有令自己骄傲的回忆 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone I think has the memories they're prouder of than others, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.47,1:47:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,或许这就是为什么我们害怕改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe that's why change is so scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.24,1:47:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那些我们想忘却的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause the things we wish we could leave behind...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.00,1:47:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 早上好啊 迈克 - 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good morning, Mike. - How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.57,1:47:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那些我们想平息的流言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whispers we wish we could silence...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.75,1:47:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他爸爸就是那个纵火犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}His pa is the one. The one that set that fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.39,1:47:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那些我们想摆脱的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nightmares we most want to wake up from,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.86,1:47:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那些我们想改变的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}the memories we wish we could change...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.35,1:47:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那些我们自以为要守住的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}the secrets we feel like we have to keep...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.31,1:48:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,都难以摆脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the hardest to walk away from.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.86,1:48:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而美好的记忆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good stuff?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.48,1:48:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,总是我们脑海中最快消逝的画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pictures in our mind that fade away the fastest?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.07,1:48:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,总是我们觉得最容易失去的自我碎片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those pieces of you it feels the easiest to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.23,1:48:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我并不愿忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I don't want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.12,1:48:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,也许今天的主题就是关于忘记 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if that's what today is all about, forget it, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.83,1:48:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 史丹利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Stanley.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.35,1:48:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我就要成人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, I'm supposed to become a man,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.03,1:48:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不觉得有什么不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't feel any different.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.11,1:48:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我是个废柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm a loser.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.28,1:48:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不管将来怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.50,1:48:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我都他妈不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always fucking will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.70,1:49:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,史丹利 谢谢你的出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for showing up, Stanley.
