Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.51,1:50:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see them yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.82,1:50:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,像炸鸡一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crisping?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.30,1:50:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,被烤得又酥又脆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like fried fucking...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.55,1:50:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该说 早就该这么干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you could say that was long overdue.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.23,1:51:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,懂没 因为是在图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it? 'Cause we're in a library.
