Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.87,1:51:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.24,1:51:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.29,1:51:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我很不好 我他妈刚杀了个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not all right. I just fucking killed a guy.
