Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.35,1:51:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Bill?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.00,1:51:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 我们在图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, we're all at the library.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.64,1:51:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you at?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.31,1:51:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,它杀了那个孩子 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took a little kid, Mike.
