Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.10,1:51:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要杀了它 - 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna go kill It. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.25,1:51:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想你们跟我一起被弄死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want any of you to get killed with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.11,1:51:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill! Bill!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.37,1:52:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他要单独行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to fight It alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.00,1:52:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.19,1:52:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,关键是大家在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the group.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.48,1:52:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大家不在一起 仪式就起不了作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual doesn't work without the group.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.37,1:52:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我们一起才有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing it together is why it'd work.
