Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.96,1:52:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你们别来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you guys, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.29,1:53:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一切因我而起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.42,1:53:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在这都是因为我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my fault that you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.23,1:53:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这个纠缠着你们每个人的 该死的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This curse, this fucking thing that's inside you all.
