Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.26,1:53:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,只因我当时只顾着找小乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}because all I cared about was finding Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.28,1:53:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我要进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm gonna go in there,
