Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.84,1:56:20.97,Note,,0,0,0,,(终于回家了)
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.63,1:56:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇 我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, what's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.83,1:57:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你 他 妈 在 逗 我 吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be fucking kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.66,1:57:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.95,1:57:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 滚开 滚开 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God damn it, get it away from me. Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.28,1:57:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.67,1:57:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.00,1:57:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.60,1:57:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 他在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.39,1:57:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,把它弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.11,1:57:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快把它弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.90,1:57:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.96,1:57:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞奇 - 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Richie! - Richie! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.28,1:58:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把它弄走 - 我要回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get it off of me! - I wanna go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.30,1:58:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,把刀给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the knife!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.03,1:58:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,操 艾迪 把刀给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it, Eddie, get the knife!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.66,1:58:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 快把它弄走啊 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill! Get it off of me, Bill! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.50,1:58:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪 把刀给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, get the knife!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.28,1:58:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.36,1:58:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.93,1:58:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.91,1:58:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.08,1:58:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他差点就死了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have fucking died, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.18,1:58:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你知不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.67,1:58:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.85,1:59:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,小乔已经死了 那个小孩死了 史丹利也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie's dead. The kid's dead. Stanley's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.33,1:59:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你想瑞奇也死掉吗 你想瑞奇也死掉吗啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want Richie, too? You want Richie, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.72,1:59:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想瑞奇死 我不想 我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want Richie, too. I don't. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.50,1:59:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不要发火了 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't be mad, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.40,1:59:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.03,1:59:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,它就想让我们害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he wants, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.50,1:59:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,别让它得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.74,1:59:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,满满的回忆哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of memories, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.11,1:59:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,都是糟心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All bad.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.81,2:00:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.61,2:00:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,都是污水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blech. Gray water.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.48,2:00:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,操 就是这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.00,2:00:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都发生在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it happened.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.08,2:01:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.89,2:01:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.95,2:01:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bevvie.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.75,2:01:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.24,2:01:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像听见了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.94,2:01:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.51,2:01:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,沉下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to sink!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.58,2:01:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.51,2:01:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:51.36,2:01:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.53,2:01:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.63,2:02:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 出来吧 求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on. Please, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.64,2:02:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想一个人离开这鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to walk out of here alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.19,2:02:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.27,2:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我都想哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like crying.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.41,2:02:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克 接下来我们去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike. Where do we go from here?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.26,2:02:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,于深渊中它匍匐\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the depths is where It crept.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.93,2:02:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,自地底寻消除之法\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the beneath, to find belief.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.72,2:02:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,于深渊中它匍匐\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the depths is where It crept.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.45,2:02:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,自地底寻消除之法\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the beneath, to find belief.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.73,2:02:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.06,2:02:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这会儿有必要这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think at this point, that's a relative question.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.30,2:02:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,另一边是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on the other side?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.06,2:02:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 没人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. No one does.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.12,2:02:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.18,2:02:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迈克 别 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike, don't. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.55,2:02:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 底下见 - 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you down there. - Mike!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.00,2:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Mike!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.26,2:02:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一起行动 - 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay together. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.89,2:03:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.92,2:03:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行 上面的事你们也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. You saw what happened up there.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.90,2:03:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我会害死你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna let you die.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.39,2:03:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我脚都动不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just fucking froze up.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.40,2:03:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要是让我跟你们下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you let me go down there with you,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.47,2:03:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把大家都害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get us all killed.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.03,2:03:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 把它给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.91,2:03:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我 - 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me that. - Richie.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.91,2:03:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,放手 臭狗屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go, you little turd.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.88,2:03:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,让我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me get...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.31,2:03:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.00,2:03:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,听我讲.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:26.46,2:03:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你要缓缓 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a moment. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.26,2:03:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但别忘了是谁还没满14岁就干掉了一个疯子小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who killed a psychotic clown before he was 14?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.04,2:03:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.62,2:03:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,谁用刺到自己脸上的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who stabbed Bowers with a knife...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.80,2:03:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,反杀了鲍尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}he pulled out of his own face?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.24,2:03:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,也是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.15,2:03:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谁娶了个比自己体积大十倍的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who married a woman 10 times his own body mass?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.80,2:03:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我 - 就是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.66,2:03:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你比自己想的更勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're braver than you think.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.15,2:03:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不觉得 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Thanks, Rich.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.14,2:03:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好痛 - 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.36,2:03:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.90,2:03:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:58.06,2:03:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这个能杀怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kills monsters.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.86,2:04:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能吗 - 能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.19,2:04:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe it does.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.23,2:04:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Bev.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.70,2:04:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys good?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.06,2:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.70,2:04:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你过得去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get through that?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.35,2:04:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一的路 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way. This way.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.12,2:04:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in here!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.25,2:04:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.63,2:04:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很窄 但过得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tight, but we can get through.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.13,2:05:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是它藏身的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where It hid.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.67,2:05:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,德利镇下面居然有这么个…上古的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, all this has been under Derry, like, forever?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.03,2:05:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不算上古\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.84,2:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,也就几百万年吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few million years.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.21,2:06:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,只有攻击它的原形才有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can only be attacked in its true form.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.61,2:06:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,仪式会告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual will show us that.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.84,2:06:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,它的原形是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what is It's true form?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.53,2:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,希望是只狗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it's a puppy.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.17,2:06:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,博美最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a Pomeranian or...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.76,2:06:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我闭麦好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll shut up.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.69,2:06:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是光\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's light.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.56,2:06:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是必须被黑暗掐灭的光\N{\fnArial\fs30}A light that must be snuffed out by darkness.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.71,2:06:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把你们的信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.29,2:06:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,都丢进火里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place them in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.35,2:06:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,过去必须跟现在一起灼烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The past must burn with the present.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:54.34,2:06:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这只纸船是我跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the boat that I built with...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.75,2:07:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小乔一起折的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.85,2:07:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的吸入器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my inhaler.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.69,2:07:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快点吧 老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, dude.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.19,2:07:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾希望抓住的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that I wish I had held on to.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.96,2:07:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是毕业纪念册的一页\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a page from my yearbook.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.04,2:07:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个人的签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}That only one person signed.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.69,2:07:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是该忘掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably should have forgotten it, but...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.28,2:07:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但我没忘 我放在我的钱包里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't, because I kept it in my wallet...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.45,2:07:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,放了27年\N{\fnArial\fs30}for 27 years.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.86,2:07:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这是首都剧院的纪念币\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a token from the Capitol Theater.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.00,2:07:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你带了个真的来 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You brought an actual token? - Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.79,2:07:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是应该做的 蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we were supposed to do, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.98,2:07:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你知不知道烧掉它要等多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how long that's gonna take to burn?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.96,2:07:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你的吸入器也是啊 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but so is your inhaler, dude.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.60,2:07:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.32,2:07:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,都是毒雾啊塑料啊这些东西 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the toxic fumes and the plastic and shit, so...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.72,2:08:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,近点看 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look closely, Bev.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.26,2:08:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see it?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.22,2:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这个来自你打鲍尔斯的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where you hit Bowers.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.60,2:08:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,扔石头那场架\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rock fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.08,2:08:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候我们友情坚固\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day these bonds were forged.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.00,2:08:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西也烧不着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna burn, either.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.06,2:08:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait.
