Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.88,2:17:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,装病的 因为我不想陪你玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretended because I didn't want to play with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:31.46,2:17:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:34.48,2:17:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我而我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied and I died.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:38.04,2:17:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我而我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied and I died.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.66,2:17:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我而我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied and I died!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.70,2:17:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我而我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied and I died!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.72,2:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都是因为我 小乔 都是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened because of me, Georgie. Me.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.70,2:17:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. It was...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.40,2:18:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,骗子 凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lied and died!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.42,2:18:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我而我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied and I died!
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.92,2:18:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这啊 小婊子 我闻到你的骚味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in there, you little shit? I can smell you.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:44.34,2:18:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你闻起来就像露易丝·莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell just like Lois Lane.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.38,2:18:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,强尼来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:28.78,2:19:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管你事业成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that success,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.36,2:19:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,减肥成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}all those sit-ups,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.08,2:19:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但在内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}but deep down,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.12,2:19:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你不过还是那个又肥又胖的窝囊废\N{\fnArial\fs30}still just a little fat, fat, fatty loser...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:38.24,2:19:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直都知道 你会孤独而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}who always knew he would die alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.50,2:19:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 骚货 - 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slut! - Bev!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.46,2:19:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.52,2:19:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,贝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bevvie.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.80,2:19:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,把门打开好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just open up the door for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.78,2:20:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗莉 你听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:03.28,2:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来爸爸这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to Daddy, now.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.76,2:20:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝 别理会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev, don't listen!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.12,2:20:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bev!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.06,2:20:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是我的乖女儿吗 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still my little girl, Bevvie?
