Dialogue: 0,2:20:18.24,2:20:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.00,2:20:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是我的乖女儿吗 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still my little girl, Bevvie?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.60,2:20:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是我的乖女儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still my little girl?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:23.68,2:20:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.70,2:20:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你个小…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little...
