Dialogue: 0,2:20:52.90,2:20:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.56,2:21:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"初月余烬未绝"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"January embers. "
