Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.54,2:21:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.96,2:21:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.51,2:21:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.14,2:21:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你是世界上最好的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the best big brother there ever was.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.36,2:21:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我们杀死了弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! We killed our little brother!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:51.54,2:21:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:53.60,2:21:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不能因为你不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just because you didn't want to play...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:55.20,2:21:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在雨天里玩耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a rainy day,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.50,2:21:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那么一次不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}just...just one time,
