Dialogue: 0,2:23:04.46,2:23:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.50,2:23:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:14.36,2:23:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的真面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:18.58,2:23:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A madman.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.58,2:23:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fuckface!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:34.56,2:23:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,想玩真心话大冒险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play Truth or Dare?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:36.32,2:23:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真心话是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a truth.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:37.54,2:23:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个又丑又肥的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a sloppy bitch!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.54,2:23:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:40.70,2:23:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,跳舞吧 草泥马的王八…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's dance! Yippee-ki-yay...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.28,2:24:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这能杀死怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kills monsters.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:19.34,2:24:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe it does.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:21.62,2:24:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe it does.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:23.94,2:24:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe it does.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.56,2:24:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe it does.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:30.30,2:24:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看招 王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beep-beep, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:52.22,2:24:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,卧了个槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.60,2:24:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich!
