Dialogue: 0,2:25:00.32,2:25:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rich, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:01.82,2:25:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:02.86,2:25:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 你没事 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah! There he is, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.70,2:25:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Richie, listen!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.30,2:25:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我杀死它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got him, man!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:09.92,2:25:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I killed It!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.18,2:25:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我真的杀死它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did! I think I killed It for real!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.80,2:25:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
