Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.48,2:25:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.54,2:25:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:36.86,2:25:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哦噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.66,2:25:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:25:55.18,2:25:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:02.86,2:26:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,小艾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eds!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:04.82,2:26:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小艾 小艾 - 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eds! Eds! - Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.22,2:26:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eds, come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:10.08,2:26:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:22.14,2:26:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,出来玩呀 窝囊废们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out and play, Losers!
Dialogue: 0,2:26:26.18,2:26:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他受伤了 他伤得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hurt. He's hurt really bad.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.38,2:26:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得带他离这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:28.78,2:26:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎么出去 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to do that, Richie?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:34.44,2:26:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost killed It.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:37.22,2:26:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那个麻风病怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leper.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:39.04,2:26:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我伤了它的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands around his throat.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:41.30,2:26:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉到它在哽噎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I could feel him choking.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:45.08,2:26:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我让它变小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made him small.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.02,2:26:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它看起来真弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed so weak.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:56.22,2:26:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,它看起来真弱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed so weak.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.92,2:27:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,沙科皮族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Shokopiwah.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:01.40,2:27:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所有生物都必须遵循\N{\fnArial\fs30}All living things must abide by...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:02.70,2:27:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,自身肉体外形的法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}the laws of the shape they inhabit.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:05.42,2:27:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:07.04,2:27:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有条通道 走这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a passageway. Through here.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:10.24,2:27:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那个隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:12.38,2:27:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,潘尼怀斯必须要让自己变小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pennywise has to make himself small...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:14.34,2:27:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,才能通过山洞的入口 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get through the entrance of the cavern, right?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:17.60,2:27:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, if we can get back there,
Dialogue: 0,2:27:19.50,2:27:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就能逼它变小 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we can force him down to size. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.42,2:27:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们让它变小\N{\fnArial\fs30}We make him small.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:23.16,2:27:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,小到我们可以杀死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small enough so we can kill him.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.56,2:27:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我能闻到你们的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can smell the stink of your fear!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:31.48,2:27:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 走吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! Go! - Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:33.44,2:27:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很窄 很窄 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's tight. It's tight. Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:49.64,2:27:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要歇一会 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a little rest. Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:54.52,2:27:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:55.50,2:27:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Richie?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:57.02,2:27:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要告诉你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:58.24,2:27:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What's up, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:02.76,2:28:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我上了你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucked your mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:08.88,2:28:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,出来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losers out!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:13.56,2:28:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.96,2:28:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:29.40,2:28:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些肮脏的小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You filthy little children.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.36,2:28:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你有备用计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a plan B, man?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:35.16,2:28:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在要怎么办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.02,2:28:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们会死 那就是结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die. That's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:38.90,2:28:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:42.74,2:28:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,让它变小的办法不止一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more than one way to make someone small.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:46.62,2:28:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:47.98,2:28:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让他相信他本来就很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him believe that he is.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:50.12,2:28:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 让他相信他本来就很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Make him believe that he is.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:51.78,2:28:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我 很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh? Me? Small?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:56.26,2:28:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我是世界吞噬者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Eater of Worlds.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.62,2:29:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对我们来说 你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to us, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:03.54,2:29:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是一个小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a clown.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:10.06,2:29:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个虚弱的老太婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a weak old woman.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.48,2:29:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,世界吞噬者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eater of Worlds.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:16.90,2:29:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,无头男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A headless boy!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:20.36,2:29:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impostor!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:23.18,2:29:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a mimic!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:26.92,2:29:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mimic!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:28.98,2:29:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个该死的恶霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fucking bully!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:31.72,2:29:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个该死的小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a fucking clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:33.12,2:29:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,世界吞噬者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eater of Worlds!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:34.46,2:29:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑 愚蠢该死的小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clown! A dumb fucking clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:37.82,2:29:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:40.98,2:29:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,麻风病怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A leper!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:43.10,2:29:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:44.96,2:29:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你是小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:46.86,2:29:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}A painting!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:47.98,2:29:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:48.80,2:29:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不怕你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid of you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:50.20,2:29:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的愚蠢干尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}A motherfucking stupid mummy!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:53.46,2:29:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:55.86,2:29:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown! Clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:59.66,2:30:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小丑 - 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clown! - Clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:02.24,2:30:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个该死的小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fucking clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:04.25,2:30:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:05.64,2:30:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 愚蠢的干尸 - 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A stupid mummy! - Clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:09.20,2:30:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑 王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:10.78,2:30:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我是世界吞噬者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Eater of Worlds!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:18.86,2:30:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:20.62,2:30:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小丑 - 你就是个小丑 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clown! - You're just a clown! Clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:23.24,2:30:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是世界吞噬者 - 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am the Eater of Worlds! - A clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:27.84,2:30:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clown! A clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:31.14,2:30:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没人害怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:33.58,2:30:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,没人害怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:37.00,2:30:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown! Clown!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:40.48,2:30:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑 小丑 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clown. Clown. Clown.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:46.84,2:30:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小丑 - 小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clown. - Clown.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:50.78,2:30:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clown.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:53.02,2:30:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧得心脏直跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a scared, beating heart.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:42.28,2:31:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.32,2:31:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all grown up.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:54.82,2:32:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie. Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:59.28,2:33:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪 我们打败了潘尼怀斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie. We got Pennywise, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:03.92,2:33:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:17.80,2:33:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:20.06,2:33:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:20.98,2:33:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事的 他只是受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all right. No, he's just hurt.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:22.14,2:33:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得带他离开这 他受伤了 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get him outta here. He's hurt. Ben.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.38,2:33:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:25.18,2:33:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得带他离开这 小贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get him outta here. Bev.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:28.20,2:33:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.04,2:33:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:33.92,2:33:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:39.30,2:33:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得走了 来吧 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go. Come on. Come on, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:41.54,2:33:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:43.02,2:33:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, buddy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:48.38,2:33:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,放下他吧 放下他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go, man. Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.88,2:33:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:51.62,2:33:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还能救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still help him, guys!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:52.96,2:33:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还能救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can still help him!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:55.78,2:33:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.06,2:33:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还能救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we can still help him!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:10.78,2:34:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:13.08,2:34:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:19.08,2:34:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,快上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:25.42,2:34:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:29.74,2:34:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:36.56,2:34:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 快 - 跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move, move! - Run!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:38.50,2:34:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:53.68,2:34:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾迪 - 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie! - No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:55.02,2:34:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:58.38,2:35:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,回去救他出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get in there and get him!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:00.12,2:35:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他还在里面啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still in there!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:12.62,2:35:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:14.58,2:35:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,2:35:22.22,2:35:25.35,Note,,0,0,0,,(此处禁止跳水)
Dialogue: 0,2:36:15.52,2:36:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:17.22,2:36:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,艾迪肯定讨厌这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie would have hated this, guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:20.38,2:36:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 用脏水清洗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Cleaning ourselves in dirty water?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:23.82,2:36:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:24.80,2:36:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be telling us...
Dialogue: 0,2:36:25.56,2:36:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会感染链球菌什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'd get streptococcal something.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:28.52,2:36:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:30.10,2:36:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但他也会让我们开怀大笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he would have made us laugh, though.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:31.60,2:36:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:33.20,2:36:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他会守护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be looking out for us.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:36.76,2:36:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,用他一直以来的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way he always was.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:42.76,2:36:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that right, Richie?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:47.54,2:36:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:18.72,2:37:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:20.62,2:37:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:22.20,2:37:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我没戴眼镜 所以我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have my glasses on,so I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.58,2:37:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是谁 但是谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}who you people are, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:27.82,2:37:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的找不到眼镜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I legit can't find my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:29.38,2:37:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:30.82,2:37:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 眼镜 - 那边看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glasses? - Go that way.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:32.36,2:37:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在这附近吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around here somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,2:37:39.62,2:37:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我看不见 - 我看到了 就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't see them. - Oh, I see them. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:41.44,2:37:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪 - 看 就在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Look. Right...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:43.71,2:37:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你直接…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just go, like...
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.64,2:37:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁碰巧摸到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody have any luck?
Dialogue: 0,2:38:49.38,2:38:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:52.38,2:38:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:03.04,2:39:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,事无永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing lasts forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:24.86,2:39:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能这样回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go home like this, guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:27.52,2:39:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈会宰了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom will kill me.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:28.82,2:39:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 你都消失整整一天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you've been gone for 24 straight hours.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:31.16,2:39:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,牛奶盒上肯定都有你的寻人启事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your face is definitely on a milk carton by now.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:33.56,2:39:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 那个呕吐物比你妈妈的拖鞋味还要恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, that puke smells worse than your mom's slippers.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:35.70,2:39:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shut up, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:37.12,2:39:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我妈妈的拖鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, first of all, my mom's slippers...
Dialogue: 0,2:39:38.64,2:39:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,闻起来像百花香味 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}smell like potpourri, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:40.80,2:39:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:42.08,2:39:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就是的 而且你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they do. And, also, how would you know...
Dialogue: 0,2:39:43.64,2:39:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈的拖鞋是什么味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they smell like in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:44.94,2:39:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,能消停会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just keep it quiet,
Dialogue: 0,2:39:45.86,2:39:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 回家再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}please, until we get home?
Dialogue: 0,2:39:47.68,2:39:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"百花香"就是法语的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Potpourri" is literally a French word...
Dialogue: 0,2:39:49.52,2:39:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"烂罐子"\N{\fnArial\fs30}meaning "rotten pot. "
Dialogue: 0,2:39:51.10,2:39:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道肯定是什么烂掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew there was something rotten about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:52.84,2:39:57.54,Note,,0,0,0,,(榆树街五号的噩梦)
Dialogue: 0,2:40:03.80,2:40:08.84,Note,,0,0,0,,(这些是他的朋友 他的母亲错了 他们不是坏朋友…)
Dialogue: 0,2:40:11.43,2:40:12.00,Note,,0,0,0,,(迈克尔·韩洛)
Dialogue: 0,2:40:14.04,2:40:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迈克 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike? - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:16.48,2:40:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我记着要来问候你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I'd check up on you.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:18.86,2:40:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,就是看看 你这次是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just to see if you learned...
Dialogue: 0,2:40:19.96,2:40:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,能写出一个好结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to finish a book for once.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:23.68,2:40:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚写完第一章\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just finished the first chapter.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:27.42,2:40:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我觉得 这次我知道要怎么写了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think I actually know where I'm going this time.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:31.56,2:40:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:32.58,2:40:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你一件事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say, can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:34.62,2:40:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:37.18,2:40:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我们这次没有失忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think we're not forgetting?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:39.92,2:40:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不像上次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like last time?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:41.92,2:40:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是因为它死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe 'cause it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:46.80,2:40:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是因为 比起遗忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe 'cause we have more...
Dialogue: 0,2:40:47.86,2:40:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有更多想要记住的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}we want to remember than we want to forget.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:50.84,2:40:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢后者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that one.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:56.34,2:40:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你决定好以后的路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You decide what you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:57.68,2:40:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,比如离开德利镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}About leaving Derry?
Dialogue: 0,2:40:58.92,2:41:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 我在这里住了27年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I've been in this cell for 27 years.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:02.60,2:41:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,正在看看哪里适合我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just seeing what It wanted me to.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:04.36,2:41:06.70,Note,,0,0,0,,(两名当地居民死于电火花引发的火灾中 孩童存活)
Dialogue: 0,2:41:08.16,2:41:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得该换片更广阔的天空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's time I saw the sky for a change.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:11.78,2:41:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧 小迈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get it, Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:14.00,2:41:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你收到信了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, did you get the letter?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:16.86,2:41:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么信\N{\fnArial\fs30}What letter?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:18.16,2:41:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,等你看到就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll know when you see it.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:20.90,2:41:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我刚刚收到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hold on. I just got the mail.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:23.22,2:41:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有一封\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got one.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:27.32,2:41:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,帕特丽夏·尤里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricia Uris?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:29.28,2:41:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,打…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:31.40,2:41:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,打开看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just read it.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:33.00,2:41:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:34.12,2:41:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,随时联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}And call me. Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:37.20,2:41:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:38.08,2:41:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Bill,
Dialogue: 0,2:41:45.30,2:41:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:47.42,2:41:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:49.46,2:41:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. See you around.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:05.52,2:42:06.80,Note,,0,0,0,,(《老德利镇的历史》)
Dialogue: 0,2:42:11.63,2:42:13.95,Note,,0,0,0,,(寻人启事)
Dialogue: 0,2:42:18.86,2:42:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的废柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Losers,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:21.36,2:42:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这看起来像什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what this must seem like,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:23.42,2:42:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不是什么遗书\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this isn't a suicide note.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:27.12,2:42:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们大概想知道我为什么这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're probably wondering why I did what I did.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:30.82,2:42:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我知道我太害怕回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because I knew I was too scared to go back.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:34.10,2:42:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们无法团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we weren't together,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:36.10,2:42:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果活着的我们无法团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}if all of us alive weren't united,
Dialogue: 0,2:42:39.38,2:42:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew we'd all die.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:41.68,2:42:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我做了唯一合乎常理的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I made the only logical move.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:46.02,2:42:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"退出"了这场冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took myself off the board.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:50.08,2:42:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:52.64,2:42:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,当然如果你在读这封信 答案你已知晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're reading this, you know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:57.84,2:42:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子都生活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived my whole life afraid.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:01.58,2:43:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕即将发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid of what would come next.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:05.78,2:43:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕我会遗忘的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid of what I might leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:10.70,2:43:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:13.64,2:43:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,做你们想做的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be who you want to be.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:17.18,2:43:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be proud.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:19.32,2:43:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,睡得好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sleep okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:21.04,2:43:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:23.42,2:43:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了个美梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a beautiful dream.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:25.76,2:43:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你找到了那个值得携手一生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you find someone worth holding on to,
Dialogue: 0,2:43:29.64,2:43:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,永远 永远不要放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}never ever let them go.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:41.24,2:43:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,走你自己的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow your own path.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:47.34,2:43:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,无论去往何方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever that takes you.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:55.28,2:43:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,把这封信当做一个承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of this letter as a promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:01.54,2:44:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一个我请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}A promise I'm asking you to make.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:04.70,2:44:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:07.02,2:44:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,为彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}To each other.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:10.58,2:44:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,许下的誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}An oath.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:15.66,2:44:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你瞧 做废柴的真谛是\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the thing about being a Loser is...
Dialogue: 0,2:44:20.44,2:44:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有可失去的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have anything to lose.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:25.30,2:44:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,2:44:27.22,2:44:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要真诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be true.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:29.20,2:44:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be brave.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:31.36,2:44:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要有骨气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:33.40,2:44:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:35.46,2:44:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 永远不要忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't ever forget...
Dialogue: 0,2:44:38.92,2:44:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是废柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're Losers,
Dialogue: 0,2:44:41.64,2:44:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,而且永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we always will be.
